WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.035
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.305 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.465 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:43.145 --> 01:44.385
My Lady, you've been gone so long.

5
01:44.465 --> 01:46.105
I've come to welcome you home.

6
01:46.185 --> 01:47.145
What's so urgent?

7
01:47.225 --> 01:49.025
The silkworm house has been fully thatched.

8
01:49.105 --> 01:50.625
We're all waiting for you to return.

9
01:50.705 --> 01:54.225
By custom, the owner must be the first to enter a newly built house.

10
01:56.985 --> 01:57.825
Look out!

11
01:59.665 --> 02:00.625
Protect Her Ladyship!

12
02:42.345 --> 02:43.265
Go! Now!

13
03:13.665 --> 03:17.385
Your Ladyship, you promised me.

14
03:18.625 --> 03:19.905
You said you'd forgiven me.

15
03:19.985 --> 03:23.705
I haven't. I hold grudges.

16
03:24.385 --> 03:25.785
You have to keep being good to me.

17
03:25.865 --> 03:27.105
You have to stay by my side.

18
03:27.185 --> 03:28.745
Only then will I forgive you.

19
03:28.825 --> 03:29.865
Bitao…

20
03:33.465 --> 03:36.185
You've suffered so much, My Lady.

21
03:37.425 --> 03:39.185
So much.

22
03:40.225 --> 03:45.785
Your adoptive mother, your birth mother, and the Wei family.

23
03:45.865 --> 03:48.265
They've all been so cruel to you.

24
03:51.185 --> 03:53.345
And so have I.

25
03:54.625 --> 03:58.505
For my own selfish reasons, I betrayed you.

26
03:59.225 --> 04:00.745
No, you didn't, Bitao.

27
04:00.825 --> 04:03.105
You're different. You're not like them.

28
04:04.105 --> 04:07.785
Those people never treated us as human.

29
04:09.705 --> 04:15.985
Every time I saw you win, it felt so, so good.

30
04:23.585 --> 04:27.225
Don't look back. Keep climbing.

31
04:27.785 --> 04:30.105
Fight your way to the top.

32
04:33.945 --> 04:39.785
Everyone who's mocked you will one day grovel at your feet.

33
04:40.505 --> 04:42.465
I will.

34
04:42.545 --> 04:45.145
No one can stand in your way.

35
04:48.545 --> 04:50.345
I can't bear to go.

36
04:51.105 --> 04:53.665
I wanted to see it for myself.

37
04:53.745 --> 04:55.305
To see your future…

38
04:56.065 --> 04:58.585
-Your future… -I'll make it happen. I will.

39
05:06.985 --> 05:07.825
Bitao…

40
05:09.545 --> 05:10.385
Bitao.

41
05:12.145 --> 05:13.585
Bitao!

42
05:21.065 --> 05:21.945
Bitao.

43
05:25.145 --> 05:26.025
Bitao.

44
05:27.625 --> 05:29.065
-Bitao… -Rao!

45
05:40.145 --> 05:41.145
-My lady. -Bitao!

46
05:41.665 --> 05:42.505
Your Ladyship.

47
05:42.585 --> 05:44.465
Bitao!

48
05:45.505 --> 05:47.745
Bitao!

49
06:06.265 --> 06:09.025
ZHUYU ESTATE

50
06:14.585 --> 06:15.705
My Lady, you've been gone so long.

51
06:15.785 --> 06:17.585
I've come to welcome you home.

52
06:20.265 --> 06:21.145
Bitao!

53
06:24.065 --> 06:25.945
Wei Rao, you're awake.

54
06:27.225 --> 06:28.385
Those bandits…

55
06:29.385 --> 06:31.385
-Have they been caught? -We caught them all.

56
06:31.465 --> 06:34.105
We used severe measures. They confessed as bandits from the South Mountain

57
06:35.705 --> 06:37.065
who had come seeking revenge.

58
06:38.185 --> 06:39.985
I've sent men to escort the Fourth Prince back to the palace.

59
06:40.505 --> 06:41.425
As for your maid,

60
06:42.465 --> 06:44.105
I've had someone arrange her funeral.

61
06:48.785 --> 06:50.185
Thank you, General Qi.

62
06:50.785 --> 06:52.025
Wei Rao, in fact…

63
06:52.105 --> 06:55.265
General Qi, I'd like some time alone.

64
06:58.185 --> 06:59.225
I'll leave you, then.

65
07:03.225 --> 07:05.385
If you need anything, let me know.

66
07:11.905 --> 07:13.305
You two may leave too.

67
07:20.385 --> 07:21.665
‎ADORNED WITH AUTUMN'S FRAGRANCE

68
08:00.345 --> 08:01.785
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

69
08:33.985 --> 08:35.505
Has Her Ladyship stayed in her room all this time?

70
08:35.585 --> 08:38.264
She won't come out or see any visitors.

71
08:38.345 --> 08:39.904
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

72
08:39.985 --> 08:41.105
You saw it yourself.

73
08:41.185 --> 08:42.825
She even turned away Lady Li's people.

74
08:42.904 --> 08:44.865
No matter what we say, she refuses to see anyone.

75
08:45.665 --> 08:46.745
What do we do?

76
08:57.185 --> 08:59.225
I'll make her want to come out of that room.

77
09:17.465 --> 09:19.265
Hurry!

78
09:19.345 --> 09:22.025
At this time of year, there's plenty to do on the estate.

79
09:22.105 --> 09:24.305
-How can you hide in here, lazing about? -Grandmother, what brings you here?

80
09:24.905 --> 09:27.545
Come on! We'll be too late!

81
09:27.625 --> 09:30.545
-Where are we going? Too late for what? -Come along. Follow me.

82
09:31.065 --> 09:34.185
-The fields need work in winter too. -Take it slow.

83
09:34.705 --> 09:35.905
Before the snow comes,

84
09:35.985 --> 09:38.385
you must plow this entire stretch of land nice and deep.

85
09:39.065 --> 09:41.705
Cover the vegetable beds and wheat rows with straw.

86
09:41.785 --> 09:43.145
The tools have been used all year,

87
09:43.225 --> 09:44.785
-so get them repaired too. -Turn the soil over there again.

88
09:44.865 --> 09:45.945
-What's real hardship? -All right.

89
09:46.025 --> 09:46.625
Let's go.

90
09:46.705 --> 09:48.665
An empty stomach. That's hardship.

91
09:48.745 --> 09:49.785
Give the people

92
09:49.865 --> 09:53.105
a decent year and a good harvest,

93
09:53.185 --> 09:56.065
and they'll have smiles on their faces.

94
09:56.665 --> 09:59.305
There are over a thousand mouths to feed

95
09:59.385 --> 10:01.505
in and around this estate.

96
10:02.185 --> 10:04.665
Just spend a few days

97
10:04.745 --> 10:06.025
working in the fields.

98
10:06.105 --> 10:09.385
-I guarantee you have no time to be sad. -Those lands are done.

99
10:10.265 --> 10:13.705
Food and land are our real lifeblood.

100
10:14.865 --> 10:16.065
Over here.

101
10:16.145 --> 10:17.105
Come.

102
10:17.625 --> 10:19.265
This is hard physical work.

103
10:19.345 --> 10:20.545
Can you manage it?

104
10:20.625 --> 10:23.905
I've done all kinds of backbreaking work, but I've never worked the fields.

105
10:24.545 --> 10:26.425
We used to be too poor to own any land.

106
10:27.425 --> 10:28.505
But I promise you, Grandmother,

107
10:28.585 --> 10:30.025
I'll work hard.

108
10:30.705 --> 10:33.305
-Good. Get to work. -We're not done yet.

109
10:33.385 --> 10:34.425
Here, give it to me.

110
10:37.545 --> 10:39.105
-Bring the ox over! -Let's move.

111
10:40.345 --> 10:41.345
All right!

112
10:53.945 --> 10:55.265
This is good soil.

113
10:56.065 --> 10:57.505
Turn it over again.

114
11:04.465 --> 11:05.465
Lady Shou'an.

115
11:09.545 --> 11:11.665
Lord Lu, what brings you here?

116
11:12.185 --> 11:13.385
Have your wounds healed?

117
11:13.985 --> 11:15.025
I happened to be passing by.

118
11:15.545 --> 11:17.265
-Thanks to Imperial Physician Liu, -Turn it over again.

119
11:17.345 --> 11:18.265
I'm much better now.

120
11:18.345 --> 11:19.265
Come.

121
11:19.345 --> 11:20.625
This one?

122
11:20.705 --> 11:21.385
Give me a hand.

123
11:23.425 --> 11:24.705
You shouldn't be doing this.

124
11:24.785 --> 11:25.665
Let me help.

125
11:25.745 --> 11:28.945
No, leading the ox is easy enough.

126
11:29.545 --> 11:32.665
If you really want to help,

127
11:34.905 --> 11:36.265
go plow the field.

128
11:37.425 --> 11:38.665
All right.

129
11:40.025 --> 11:41.345
Give it to me.

130
11:43.945 --> 11:44.985
I wouldn't dare trouble you, My Lord.

131
11:45.665 --> 11:46.625
Afraid my wounds haven't healed?

132
11:47.825 --> 11:48.625
-What's this? -Hold it steady.

133
11:48.705 --> 11:50.105
-All right. -Are you worried about me?

134
11:50.185 --> 11:51.865
Put it here.

135
11:54.145 --> 11:56.665
Since you're so eager to help, you can handle the plow.

136
11:57.465 --> 11:59.225
I've seen others drive the ox and plow at the same time.

137
11:59.865 --> 12:01.265
With your martial skills,

138
12:01.345 --> 12:03.065
a little task like this should be no challenge.

139
12:03.145 --> 12:05.185
I'm flattered.

140
12:05.265 --> 12:06.585
I won't disappoint you.

141
12:10.745 --> 12:14.665
Surely you know the field must be cleared before plowing, right?

142
12:14.745 --> 12:17.665
I'll leave the weeds and stones for you to clear away.

143
12:20.945 --> 12:21.945
Bring me a basket.

144
12:29.825 --> 12:31.345
I really am getting old.

145
12:31.425 --> 12:32.705
I'll leave you two to it.

146
12:33.305 --> 12:34.745
Work hard. No slacking.

147
12:34.825 --> 12:36.105
Come.

148
12:39.185 --> 12:40.145
Grandmother…

149
12:45.065 --> 12:45.905
Over here.

150
12:48.105 --> 12:48.945
Come.

151
12:49.825 --> 12:50.865
Be careful.

152
13:00.865 --> 13:02.505
Turn the soil over here again!

153
13:07.865 --> 13:08.705
Some more?

154
13:11.545 --> 13:12.425
Come.

155
13:12.505 --> 13:13.665
Coming!

156
13:15.305 --> 13:16.145
Careful!

157
13:20.865 --> 13:21.905
Be careful.

158
13:23.985 --> 13:25.065
Did you ask Grandmother to come?

159
13:26.465 --> 13:32.825
Lu Zhuo, you said it yourself that our marriage was a mistake.

160
13:32.905 --> 13:33.905
The sooner we ended it, the better.

161
13:34.505 --> 13:35.825
I've changed my mind.

162
13:36.665 --> 13:37.705
You're going back on your word?

163
13:39.505 --> 13:42.745
Back then, I risked my life to clear obstacles for you.

164
13:43.665 --> 13:46.225
You swore you'd repay my kindness.

165
13:47.545 --> 13:49.065
Now you've turned your back on me.

166
13:49.145 --> 13:52.185
Who's really going back on their word?

167
13:52.265 --> 13:53.465
You…

168
14:12.585 --> 14:17.705
AS THE SUN RISES

169
14:17.785 --> 14:18.905
You must be exhausted.

170
14:23.145 --> 14:26.705
Now I really understand why you don't like Lu Zhuo.

171
14:26.785 --> 14:31.505
While you were there, he worked so hard at plowing.

172
14:31.585 --> 14:34.745
The moment you left, he found an excuse and slipped away.

173
14:35.465 --> 14:38.185
My poor old back nearly broke.

174
14:41.745 --> 14:42.585
You don't believe me?

175
14:43.185 --> 14:45.785
Lu Zhuo is stubborn and keeps his word.

176
14:45.865 --> 14:47.345
He wouldn't leave a job half done.

177
14:47.865 --> 14:49.265
You're just teasing him.

178
14:49.345 --> 14:51.225
That's right!

179
14:51.305 --> 14:54.265
He really did work hard.

180
14:54.345 --> 14:56.425
He plowed the field and harrowed it too.

181
14:56.505 --> 15:00.065
Anyone watching would have taken him for one of our tenant farmers.

182
15:00.625 --> 15:02.505
Come.

183
15:05.625 --> 15:06.465
Look.

184
15:11.345 --> 15:13.185
Where did you find such an adorable puppy?

185
15:13.265 --> 15:15.905
Lord Lu gave it to me.

186
15:15.985 --> 15:17.905
Of course it's adorable.

187
15:23.465 --> 15:25.825
How could you accept a gift from him?

188
15:25.905 --> 15:27.145
You know perfectly well…

189
15:27.825 --> 15:29.545
I don't know anything.

190
15:29.625 --> 15:32.785
I just know that a young man gave me this lovely little dog.

191
15:33.425 --> 15:36.225
Besides, he gave it to me, not you.

192
15:36.305 --> 15:38.065
What's bothering you?

193
15:38.145 --> 15:41.585
So you'd sell out your own granddaughter for a puppy?

194
15:41.665 --> 15:42.505
Never.

195
15:42.585 --> 15:47.865
Even a mountain of gold wouldn't be worth as much as you.

196
15:48.785 --> 15:50.225
As for Lord Lu,

197
15:50.305 --> 15:54.505
don't let him sweet-talk you into getting back together with him.

198
15:54.585 --> 15:56.825
What's so great about presiding over the Lu household?

199
15:56.905 --> 16:00.625
If you ask me, if you want to marry again,

200
16:01.225 --> 16:03.145
take a husband into your own household.

201
16:03.225 --> 16:05.425
Choose someone young and handsome.

202
16:05.505 --> 16:06.385
Wouldn't that be 100 times better

203
16:06.465 --> 16:08.625
than marrying into some great noble family?

204
16:08.705 --> 16:09.985
I'm in no mood to think about that.

205
16:26.265 --> 16:27.425
Then what are you thinking about?

206
16:28.105 --> 16:29.065
Revenge?

207
16:34.545 --> 16:35.385
You know?

208
16:35.465 --> 16:37.705
Anyone with eyes can see it.

209
16:37.785 --> 16:38.985
But don't even think about it.

210
16:39.585 --> 16:44.665
She may lack virtue and intelligence and be narrow-minded and despicable,

211
16:44.745 --> 16:46.585
but she belongs to the Han clan.

212
16:47.105 --> 16:49.225
So does the Empress Dowager.

213
16:49.865 --> 16:50.985
For that reason alone,

214
16:51.065 --> 16:52.905
His Majesty would never depose the Empress.

215
16:55.465 --> 16:56.305
My child,

216
16:57.305 --> 17:01.385
I know you've suffered so many wrongs.

217
17:01.465 --> 17:06.265
But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.

218
17:08.105 --> 17:09.704
Promise me, will you?

219
17:20.944 --> 17:22.065
I'll do as you say.

220
17:36.785 --> 17:39.625
ZHUYU ESTATE

221
17:42.065 --> 17:44.225
Lord Lu, that was thoughtful of you.

222
17:44.305 --> 17:46.465
Thank you for coming to Xianzhuang to let me know.

223
17:46.545 --> 17:51.025
You're wise and worldly, Lady Shou'an. Wei Rao respects you deeply.

224
17:51.625 --> 17:53.345
Only you can talk sense into her.

225
17:53.865 --> 17:55.305
I should be thanking you.

226
17:55.825 --> 17:57.265
I'm not so sure.

227
17:57.345 --> 17:58.905
Ever since childhood,

228
17:58.985 --> 18:02.105
Rao has endured hardship and faced so much scorn.

229
18:02.705 --> 18:06.225
Naturally, she's learned to hide her feelings.

230
18:07.185 --> 18:10.105
I'm afraid she'll say one thing and do another.

231
18:10.785 --> 18:12.145
I'll keep an eye on her.

232
18:12.225 --> 18:15.185
Lord Lu, have you really thought this through?

233
18:15.265 --> 18:16.945
This won't be an easy path.

234
18:17.545 --> 18:19.385
You may have nothing to show for it.

235
18:19.465 --> 18:20.705
Turn back while you still can.

236
18:20.785 --> 18:22.465
I wanted to turn back too.

237
18:24.185 --> 18:25.745
But I struggled with it for so long.

238
18:26.265 --> 18:27.585
I finally realized

239
18:29.785 --> 18:31.025
I could no longer turn back.

240
18:32.065 --> 18:33.505
Luckily, I never leave things half done.

241
18:34.105 --> 18:37.185
However difficult this path may be, I'll follow it to the end.

242
18:38.585 --> 18:39.585
Very well.

243
18:40.145 --> 18:41.345
Take good care of her.

244
18:48.065 --> 18:49.385
Thank you, Grandmother.

245
18:49.905 --> 18:50.785
I'll remember it.

246
19:08.905 --> 19:11.105
My Lady, Lady Li urgently summoned you to the palace.

247
19:11.185 --> 19:12.585
I wonder what she wants.

248
19:22.145 --> 19:23.025
Greetings, Your Majesty.

249
19:23.945 --> 19:26.825
Noble Lady Wu'an, you're in quite a hurry.

250
19:26.905 --> 19:27.985
Where are you going?

251
19:28.065 --> 19:31.265
Your Majesty, Lady Li has summoned me.

252
19:31.345 --> 19:32.545
-I'm on my way… -Never mind who summoned you.

253
19:33.145 --> 19:35.625
Palace rules dictate that all titled ladies visiting the palace

254
19:35.705 --> 19:38.305
must first pay their respects to Her Majesty.

255
19:43.785 --> 19:45.145
I'm unfamiliar with palace rules.

256
19:45.665 --> 19:46.785
Please forgive me, Your Majesty.

257
19:47.745 --> 19:51.105
Perhaps you don't realize how strict our palace rules are.

258
19:51.745 --> 19:54.065
Even a maid who accidentally drops a jade cup

259
19:54.145 --> 19:57.225
must have her nose, lips, and tongue cut off.

260
19:57.745 --> 19:59.665
Entering without paying your respects to me

261
19:59.745 --> 20:02.145
shows grave disrespect to the imperial family.

262
20:02.225 --> 20:05.745
Tell me, how should I punish you?

263
20:09.985 --> 20:13.865
I know you've suffered so many wrongs.

264
20:13.945 --> 20:17.545
But for now, you mustn't think of revenge.

265
20:21.985 --> 20:23.545
I've been rash and ignorant.

266
20:24.545 --> 20:26.385
Please show mercy, Your Majesty.

267
20:26.985 --> 20:28.065
Back then,

268
20:28.145 --> 20:30.265
you were so glib before the Empress Dowager

269
20:30.345 --> 20:31.585
with all your clever arguments.

270
20:31.665 --> 20:33.585
At the tournament, you humiliated me in front of everyone

271
20:33.665 --> 20:34.905
by refusing to marry.

272
20:34.985 --> 20:36.945
How smug and arrogant you were.

273
20:37.905 --> 20:38.785
What's this?

274
20:39.585 --> 20:43.985
One maid dies, and you're scared out of your wits?

275
20:44.705 --> 20:47.865
Since you're young and ignorant of the rules,

276
20:48.545 --> 20:50.945
your maid can take your punishment.

277
20:51.025 --> 20:52.705
Have mercy, Your Majesty! I was wrong!

278
20:52.785 --> 20:53.745
Have mercy, Your Majesty!

279
20:55.625 --> 20:58.705
-Your Majesty… -How dare you look Her Majesty in the eye!

280
21:01.585 --> 21:04.065
Servants are punished for their masters' mistakes.

281
21:04.145 --> 21:08.465
Even His Majesty couldn't accuse me of being harsh.

282
21:09.225 --> 21:10.785
Noble Lady Wu'an,

283
21:12.505 --> 21:14.225
wouldn't you agree?

284
22:03.305 --> 22:04.745
I alone am at fault.

285
22:06.945 --> 22:08.225
My maid knew no better.

286
22:08.905 --> 22:12.785
Please, Your Majesty, punish me and spare her.

287
22:25.545 --> 22:28.065
So you do know how to act obediently.

288
22:29.305 --> 22:32.305
You're much more perceptive than your mother.

289
22:32.385 --> 22:34.625
Never forget how lowly you are.

290
22:35.585 --> 22:39.545
Know your place, and you'll live longer.

291
23:14.065 --> 23:15.745
ZHAOYANG PALACE

292
23:15.825 --> 23:17.665
My mother is worried about you.

293
23:17.745 --> 23:19.825
She wants you to stay with her in Luoyang for a while.

294
23:20.505 --> 23:23.865
The capital may be prosperous, but its scenery is no match for Luoyang's.

295
23:23.945 --> 23:24.785
SPLENDID AS BLOSSOMS

296
23:24.865 --> 23:27.785
If you leave now, you'll still be in time for the Peony Festival.

297
23:28.585 --> 23:31.825
Everyone in the city, young and old, will put flowers in their hair.

298
23:31.905 --> 23:34.065
Music will fill ancient temples and grand homes.

299
23:34.145 --> 23:36.945
It'll be far more peaceful and pleasant than here.

300
23:37.025 --> 23:38.545
I wish I could go with you.

301
23:39.865 --> 23:40.865
Rao,

302
23:41.905 --> 23:43.705
I'll have Shuo escort you.

303
23:43.785 --> 23:45.145
Would you like that?

304
23:48.825 --> 23:50.785
There's something I want to ask Your Ladyship.

305
23:53.905 --> 23:55.465
Since you entered the palace,

306
23:55.985 --> 23:58.425
you've spent over a decade striving for power.

307
24:00.505 --> 24:02.025
Don't you want to be Empress?

308
24:04.425 --> 24:06.145
-Rao… -The one standing in your way

309
24:07.425 --> 24:08.705
is the Empress Dowager.

310
24:13.065 --> 24:15.465
The Empress is the Empress Dowager's niece.

311
24:16.265 --> 24:18.625
Though she's jealous of others' talents and unfit for her position,

312
24:19.825 --> 24:22.625
she's protected by the Empress Dowager and the Han clan.

313
24:22.705 --> 24:24.585
Filial piety is the foundation of our rule.

314
24:24.665 --> 24:26.545
His Majesty cannot defy the Empress Dowager,

315
24:26.625 --> 24:29.385
so the Empress's position is unassailable.

316
24:30.145 --> 24:31.905
Apart from the Empress,

317
24:32.785 --> 24:38.065
the other powerful consorts are Lady Zheng and Lady Wang.

318
24:40.145 --> 24:40.985
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

319
24:41.065 --> 24:43.905
Lady Zheng's father and brother have both served as Grand Commandant.

320
24:43.985 --> 24:46.345
Her family is illustrious and highly respected.

321
24:46.865 --> 24:48.105
Her son,

322
24:48.185 --> 24:50.545
Prince Duan, Liu Shou, can wield both the pen and the sword.

323
24:51.185 --> 24:53.065
Compared with the Empress's adopted son, Prince Jing,

324
24:53.145 --> 24:54.545
he has greater support among court officials.

325
24:55.505 --> 24:57.945
His Majesty particularly favors him.

326
24:58.665 --> 24:59.665
AUSPICIOUS DAYS, JOYOUS GATHERINGS

327
24:59.745 --> 25:01.585
The Wang family is wealthier than any other.

328
25:01.665 --> 25:02.625
When Lady Wang entered the palace,

329
25:03.225 --> 25:05.545
she gave His Majesty ten copper mines.

330
25:06.065 --> 25:09.305
She spent a billion coins on gifts to her servants alone.

331
25:09.945 --> 25:11.785
Her son, Prince Fu, Liu Ding,

332
25:12.305 --> 25:14.505
is seeking a wife whose family can bolster his position.

333
25:15.865 --> 25:17.745
The Empress has the Empress Dowager's backing.

334
25:18.985 --> 25:22.505
Lady Zheng and Lady Wang have either noble lineage or vast wealth,

335
25:23.225 --> 25:25.545
and their sons are highly capable.

336
25:25.625 --> 25:27.505
None of them is easy to contend with.

337
25:28.025 --> 25:30.625
-I don't want you dragged into this. -But I already am.

338
25:36.265 --> 25:37.105
Is my sister here?

339
25:37.185 --> 25:38.105
I want to see her.

340
25:38.185 --> 25:39.025
Your…

341
25:39.945 --> 25:41.465
-Rao! -You promised me, Your Ladyship,

342
25:42.185 --> 25:44.305
that I'd never be wronged again.

343
25:46.705 --> 25:47.665
She was only a maid.

344
25:48.465 --> 25:52.305
If you want, I can give you a hundred or a thousand more.

345
25:52.385 --> 25:54.065
But you mustn't put yourself in danger.

346
25:54.145 --> 25:55.345
In your eyes,

347
25:55.945 --> 25:57.905
she was just a lowly maid.

348
25:59.465 --> 26:00.705
But she was the one

349
26:01.425 --> 26:03.905
who stayed with me through my most uncertain and difficult days.

350
26:04.905 --> 26:05.945
To me,

351
26:06.665 --> 26:08.825
she was closer than you,

352
26:09.825 --> 26:11.065
my own birth mother.

353
26:18.265 --> 26:19.825
Do you still hate me?

354
26:25.225 --> 26:26.265
Mother.

355
26:29.145 --> 26:30.025
Mother.

356
26:31.905 --> 26:34.385
It's getting late. Rao shouldn't stay in the palace too long.

357
26:34.465 --> 26:35.785
I'll escort her out.

358
26:35.865 --> 26:37.985
Tomorrow, you'll escort your grandmother and your sister to Luoyang.

359
26:38.065 --> 26:39.465
I'm not going anywhere.

360
26:40.505 --> 26:41.985
I'm staying in the capital!

361
26:42.065 --> 26:43.945
Is it really wise to stay here?

362
26:44.025 --> 26:45.465
Wei Rao, stop right there!

363
26:48.785 --> 26:52.025
I'll settle this score sooner or later.

364
26:53.025 --> 26:54.225
She'll only complicate things by staying.

365
26:54.825 --> 26:55.945
Go persuade her.

366
26:56.025 --> 26:57.065
Make sure she leaves the capital soon.

367
27:05.145 --> 27:05.985
Rao.

368
27:06.065 --> 27:06.825
BAIHU HALL

369
27:06.905 --> 27:07.865
Rao.

370
27:08.785 --> 27:11.225
Rao, you shouldn't have argued with Mother.

371
27:11.305 --> 27:12.465
She only wants what's best for you.

372
27:12.545 --> 27:13.545
Your Highness,

373
27:14.265 --> 27:15.825
look at my maid's face before you say that.

374
27:17.825 --> 27:19.825
Must I really hide in the countryside near Luoyang

375
27:19.905 --> 27:21.225
just to escape this danger?

376
27:21.305 --> 27:23.105
If you're angry, take it out on me.

377
27:23.185 --> 27:25.025
-As for Shou's meals and daily routine… -How can you blame Mother?

378
27:25.785 --> 27:27.225
That's no way to show filial piety!

379
27:27.305 --> 27:29.025
You've always been the one who's enjoyed Mother's love.

380
27:29.105 --> 27:31.065
I've never had any of it.

381
27:31.145 --> 27:32.025
Rao?

382
27:32.105 --> 27:34.545
You aren't the one facing blades and arrows.

383
27:35.185 --> 27:36.385
No wonder you make it sound so easy.

384
27:36.465 --> 27:38.265
Even if you're jealous,

385
27:38.345 --> 27:40.785
you shouldn't make a scene in public and damage Mother's reputation.

386
27:40.865 --> 27:42.665
You're coming with me. I won't let you get away with this. Come!

387
27:42.745 --> 27:44.105
-Liu Shuo! -Come on!

388
27:44.185 --> 27:44.905
Let go of me!

389
27:46.505 --> 27:47.905
-Rao! -Go check on her.

390
27:49.185 --> 27:50.385
Rao!

391
27:52.705 --> 27:54.065
Come on. Careful.

392
27:55.425 --> 27:56.705
Are you hurt?

393
27:57.505 --> 27:58.505
Liu Shuo, how dare you!

394
27:59.105 --> 28:00.705
No wonder His Majesty is always scolding you for being rash.

395
28:01.345 --> 28:02.665
This is disgraceful.

396
28:02.745 --> 28:05.945
I'll be sure to tell His Majesty and have you properly punished.

397
28:15.025 --> 28:16.265
My dear,

398
28:16.825 --> 28:18.745
you can't leave the palace looking like this.

399
28:19.465 --> 28:21.225
People will talk.

400
28:21.825 --> 28:25.065
Why don't you come to my chambers and tidy yourself up?

401
28:25.145 --> 28:27.585
Then I'll have your cousin escort you home.

402
28:30.265 --> 28:31.105
Come on.

403
28:49.145 --> 28:50.505
DEW AND BLOSSOMS

404
28:50.585 --> 28:52.705
Of all His Majesty's children,

405
28:53.425 --> 28:55.905
Liu Shuo is the most unruly.

406
28:56.785 --> 28:59.745
He's like a wild horse,

407
29:00.305 --> 29:02.585
with no talent for letters or arms.

408
29:03.105 --> 29:04.985
His Majesty has admonished him time and again,

409
29:05.065 --> 29:05.905
but he never changes.

410
29:06.945 --> 29:10.385
You are a forgiving girl.

411
29:11.065 --> 29:13.265
Don't hold it against him.

412
29:14.105 --> 29:16.385
He and I were born of the same mother,

413
29:16.905 --> 29:18.945
yet my cousin Shu cares for me more.

414
29:20.225 --> 29:22.665
I thought that once I found my birth mother,

415
29:22.745 --> 29:24.305
I'd have someone to protect me.

416
29:25.305 --> 29:29.105
I never imagined she'd refuse to stand up for me too.

417
29:29.865 --> 29:32.225
Perhaps Lady Li has her reasons.

418
29:35.345 --> 29:39.905
Your cousin has told me the whole story of your birth.

419
29:41.105 --> 29:42.265
What I don't understand is,

420
29:42.865 --> 29:45.425
are wealth and power really worth so much?

421
29:46.105 --> 29:49.985
How could a mother bear to see her own daughter

422
29:50.825 --> 29:52.825
treated so cruelly?

423
29:53.625 --> 29:55.385
She's far too heartless.

424
29:55.465 --> 29:57.825
If I had a sweet, lovely daughter like you,

425
29:59.705 --> 30:02.825
why, I could never love her enough.

426
30:03.385 --> 30:04.825
I could only dream of having one.

427
30:05.985 --> 30:07.265
From now on,

428
30:07.785 --> 30:10.905
if anyone wrongs you, come straight to my chambers.

429
30:11.505 --> 30:13.545
I can at least offer you some comfort.

430
30:25.665 --> 30:28.105
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

431
30:28.185 --> 30:29.185
Careful.

432
30:30.825 --> 30:31.665
My Lord.

433
30:33.425 --> 30:34.665
You must be tired.

434
30:36.185 --> 30:37.505
-Take care. -See you next time.

435
30:38.105 --> 30:38.905
Who was visiting?

436
30:38.985 --> 30:40.785
Someone from the Qi family, the Marquis of Pingxi's household.

437
30:42.625 --> 30:43.825
Fresh vegetables!

438
30:43.905 --> 30:44.745
Please make way.

439
30:44.825 --> 30:46.265
Get your fresh greens!

440
30:47.465 --> 30:49.465
-Here you are, sir. -Thanks.

441
30:49.545 --> 30:52.345
What? He really went?

442
30:52.425 --> 30:54.465
Of course. Plenty of people saw him.

443
30:55.905 --> 30:57.385
Good!

444
30:58.945 --> 30:59.785
Good!

445
30:59.865 --> 31:00.705
BENEVOLENCE SPREADS FAR AND WIDE

446
31:10.465 --> 31:12.825
What's made you so happy, Grandmother?

447
31:13.345 --> 31:14.225
You're beaming.

448
31:14.305 --> 31:20.425
Wanniang, tell your dear son why the Qi family came to visit.

449
31:20.505 --> 31:24.505
The Marquis of Pingxi wishes to marry

450
31:24.585 --> 31:26.265
Noble Lady Wu'an on Zhongkai's behalf.

451
31:26.345 --> 31:30.345
Out of respect for the long friendship between our families,

452
31:30.425 --> 31:33.545
they came to sound us out first.

453
31:33.625 --> 31:35.025
What?

454
31:35.105 --> 31:36.905
Don't worry. Actually…

455
31:36.985 --> 31:39.505
Actually, they were worrying over nothing.

456
31:39.585 --> 31:42.185
Lu Zhuo is so magnanimous.

457
31:42.265 --> 31:46.385
Even if Wei Rao marries General Qi, he'll have no objection.

458
31:46.465 --> 31:50.705
After all, one is the ex-wife of an convenience marriage just to bring luck.

459
31:50.785 --> 31:53.825
The other is a brother-in-arms who's faced death alongside him.

460
31:53.905 --> 31:55.385
If they tie the knot…

461
31:55.465 --> 31:56.625
Did you agree to it too, Grandmother?

462
31:57.385 --> 32:00.305
As long as Wei Rao is willing,

463
32:00.385 --> 32:04.505
even Lady Li would have no objection.

464
32:04.585 --> 32:07.425
Who am I, an outsider, to have a say?

465
32:10.465 --> 32:11.745
Zhuo! Lu Zhuo!

466
32:11.825 --> 32:13.145
Where are you going?

467
32:14.945 --> 32:17.425
Mother, why must you tease him?

468
32:17.505 --> 32:21.345
When the Qi family came to sound us out, didn't you send them away?

469
32:21.425 --> 32:22.505
You never agreed to anything.

470
32:23.105 --> 32:26.625
He acts so hard-hearted and stubborn in public,

471
32:26.705 --> 32:28.785
then secretly goes and plows her fields.

472
32:28.865 --> 32:30.305
Even kept it from his own family.

473
32:30.385 --> 32:32.665
Look how anxious he is now.

474
32:33.905 --> 32:34.745
Serves him right!

475
32:37.105 --> 32:37.945
Bravo!

476
32:50.745 --> 32:53.985
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

477
32:54.985 --> 32:55.825
You may all leave.

478
32:55.905 --> 32:57.745
CAISHU HALL

479
32:58.385 --> 32:59.705
Why have they stopped?

480
33:01.065 --> 33:04.665
Even the finest performance is pointless if no one appreciates it.

481
33:06.785 --> 33:10.385
Wei Rao, what's troubling you that you can't tell me?

482
33:14.745 --> 33:19.585
A lowly night-soil woman is now Noble Lady Wu'an,

483
33:20.785 --> 33:23.145
with a generous stipend and a fief.

484
33:24.225 --> 33:25.945
It's what so many people dream of.

485
33:27.225 --> 33:28.945
What more could I want?

486
33:37.465 --> 33:38.305
Wei Rao,

487
33:40.025 --> 33:41.345
I want to marry you.

488
33:44.425 --> 33:45.265
You…

489
33:45.785 --> 33:46.745
I know, to protect yourself,

490
33:46.825 --> 33:49.425
you've had to keep both Lu Zhuo and me on your side.

491
33:50.905 --> 33:53.305
I'm happy to help you,

492
33:53.385 --> 33:55.785
but I wish I have met you earlier.

493
33:56.785 --> 33:58.145
Alone at midnight,

494
33:58.225 --> 34:00.105
I used to lie awake, thinking over and over.

495
34:00.905 --> 34:03.745
If you truly loved each other and were truly husband and wife,

496
34:06.145 --> 34:07.585
however much it hurt,

497
34:09.025 --> 34:10.065
I could hide my feelings.

498
34:11.105 --> 34:12.705
But he actually let you go.

499
34:13.344 --> 34:15.505
Clearly, you meant nothing to him.

500
34:16.344 --> 34:18.425
Only then, I feel I can confess what is in my heart.

501
34:21.425 --> 34:24.905
General Qi, you don't really know me.

502
34:24.985 --> 34:28.545
Before I met you, I didn't even know myself.

503
34:30.344 --> 34:32.145
I foolishly pictured my future wife,

504
34:33.025 --> 34:36.905
hoping she'd be gentle, virtuous, poised, and gracious.

505
34:37.665 --> 34:39.145
But once I met you,

506
34:40.065 --> 34:41.744
I can no longer picture her as anyone else.

507
34:47.945 --> 34:49.425
What if I say no?

508
34:51.744 --> 34:54.385
If you say yes, I'll do everything I can to keep you safe.

509
34:54.465 --> 34:55.705
If you say no,

510
34:56.225 --> 34:57.745
it means I haven't done enough.

511
34:58.305 --> 35:00.225
I'll try a hundred, even a thousand times harder.

512
35:01.705 --> 35:06.265
Even when my hair turns gray and my teeth loosen with age,

513
35:08.105 --> 35:09.625
I'll be waiting for you to say yes.

514
35:24.305 --> 35:27.425
FLOURISHING LIKE THE PINES

515
35:37.345 --> 35:38.385
Rao,

516
35:38.905 --> 35:40.425
the proprieties come before everything.

517
35:40.945 --> 35:43.065
Even I have to bow to them.

518
35:43.905 --> 35:45.425
You must do the same.

519
35:47.785 --> 35:49.305
Never forget how lowly you are.

520
35:50.625 --> 35:53.825
Know your place, and you'll live longer.

521
35:54.465 --> 35:55.665
The proprieties?

522
35:57.625 --> 36:00.145
I know nothing of them.

523
36:02.105 --> 36:05.025
All I know is debts must be paid, and murderers must die.

524
36:05.985 --> 36:07.905
She holds human life so cheap.

525
36:09.225 --> 36:11.465
She's unfit to be Empress.

526
36:13.985 --> 36:16.705
However high she sits as Empress,

527
36:17.345 --> 36:21.545
I'll drag her down from her throne.

528
36:23.945 --> 36:25.105
It's Jinzi.

529
36:25.185 --> 36:26.145
It's running all over the place again.

530
36:29.625 --> 36:30.465
Bring it here.

531
36:33.905 --> 36:34.945
Yes.

532
36:43.585 --> 36:44.705
Come out!

533
36:44.785 --> 36:45.745
Jinzi!

534
36:45.825 --> 36:47.145
CAISHU HALL

535
36:47.225 --> 36:48.465
Jinzi?

536
36:50.505 --> 36:51.545
Jinzi?

537
36:52.745 --> 36:53.905
Come out, you wretched dog!

538
36:53.985 --> 36:55.185
What's wrong?

539
36:55.705 --> 36:57.665
That stupid, filthy dog ran off with my earring.

540
36:57.745 --> 36:58.985
Go catch it.

541
36:59.065 --> 37:00.905
Lord Lu gave that dog to Her Ladyship.

542
37:00.985 --> 37:01.945
She adores it.

543
37:02.025 --> 37:02.865
How can you…?

544
37:02.945 --> 37:04.265
Don't use Her Ladyship's name to pressure me.

545
37:05.025 --> 37:05.985
All of you, go look for the dog.

546
37:06.065 --> 37:07.025
Catch that dog right now!

547
37:08.585 --> 37:09.825
That wretched dog.

548
37:11.185 --> 37:12.025
Gejin!

549
37:12.105 --> 37:13.105
Come out, you wretched dog!

550
37:13.985 --> 37:14.905
Jinzi!

551
37:32.785 --> 37:34.425
How dare you sneak in here so late at night?

552
37:46.265 --> 37:47.105
What?

553
37:48.225 --> 37:51.625
Qi Zhongkai can visit, but I can't?

554
37:52.145 --> 37:52.985
How dare you!

555
38:33.505 --> 38:35.465
Guards!

556
38:42.705 --> 38:46.025
Everyone knows Lord Lu is honorable and upright,

557
38:46.105 --> 38:47.985
a true gentleman.

558
38:48.065 --> 38:49.345
Yet you sneaked into a lady's chamber at night.

559
38:49.945 --> 38:51.865
Aren't you afraid it'll ruin your reputation?

560
38:55.705 --> 38:57.425
Why are you laughing? Have you lost your mind?

561
39:02.745 --> 39:05.105
Go ahead. Call everyone here.

562
39:05.905 --> 39:07.305
Let the whole world know

563
39:07.385 --> 39:11.025
Noble Lady Wu'an and her former husband are having a midnight tryst.

564
39:11.105 --> 39:13.065
-You…! -Your Ladyship!

565
39:14.185 --> 39:15.265
Your Ladyship!

566
39:15.985 --> 39:16.825
Your Ladyship!

567
39:17.425 --> 39:19.305
Your Ladyship, where's the intruder?

568
39:21.385 --> 39:24.385
It's night, and the candlelight is dim.

569
39:24.465 --> 39:25.785
My eyes played tricks on me.

570
39:25.865 --> 39:27.545
I mistook a tree's shadow for a person.

571
39:27.625 --> 39:28.625
All is well. You may leave.

572
39:29.265 --> 39:30.105
-Yes. -Yes.

573
39:33.345 --> 39:35.785
Lu Zhuo, why won't you leave me alone?

574
39:38.745 --> 39:43.025
I've come to talk to Your Ladyship about a deal.

575
39:44.505 --> 39:45.345
What kind of deal?

576
39:46.425 --> 39:48.105
The Empress schemed to force you into marriage

577
39:48.185 --> 39:49.065
and killed your beloved maid.

578
39:49.745 --> 39:52.465
Knowing you, you must hate her bitterly

579
39:53.905 --> 39:55.625
and be desperate for revenge.

580
40:00.425 --> 40:01.505
Go on.

581
40:03.785 --> 40:05.825
Han Liao conspired with the Huta.

582
40:05.905 --> 40:06.985
He leaked military secrets,

583
40:07.505 --> 40:10.585
nearly killing me and costing me soldiers and officers.

584
40:11.585 --> 40:13.385
I won't rest until he's dead.

585
40:14.945 --> 40:18.785
If the Han clan is our common enemy,

586
40:38.865 --> 40:40.465
why shouldn't we work together?

587
40:41.585 --> 40:45.065
Qi Zhongkai can't help you achieve what you want.

588
40:46.145 --> 40:48.345
He still answers to his father and elder brother.

589
40:49.105 --> 40:51.265
Neither in the Marquis of Pingxi's household nor in the army

590
40:52.745 --> 40:54.345
does he have the final say.

591
40:55.865 --> 40:57.105
I'm different.

592
41:05.425 --> 41:06.425
In all the world,

593
41:07.225 --> 41:09.665
I'm the only one who knows what you want.

594
41:12.025 --> 41:13.305
And I'm the only one

595
41:14.345 --> 41:16.225
who can help you get it,

596
41:19.345 --> 41:20.185
Wei Rao.

597
41:22.505 --> 41:23.745
Why?

598
41:24.505 --> 41:26.065
Don't hesitate any longer.

599
41:26.945 --> 41:28.785
I have everything you want.

600
41:30.825 --> 41:33.625
If you need me, just come to me.

601
41:35.705 --> 41:37.145
I'd do it gladly.

602
41:40.825 --> 41:43.785
You came all this way just to tell me that?

603
41:46.185 --> 41:47.425
I had to.

604
41:48.265 --> 41:50.105
I was afraid someone would offer you a little favor,

605
41:51.425 --> 41:53.025
and you'd run off with him.

606
41:55.345 --> 41:56.185
There.

607
41:56.705 --> 41:57.625
It's your turn to choose.

608
42:13.705 --> 42:15.305
Do I even have a choice?

609
42:43.465 --> 42:44.825
Where on earth is it hiding?

610
42:46.585 --> 42:47.785
That wretched dog.

611
43:04.425 --> 43:05.425
Chilan.

612
43:06.465 --> 43:07.825
Have you found Jinzi?

613
43:08.345 --> 43:09.185
Chilan!

614
43:12.385 --> 43:13.305
Gejin.

615
43:14.065 --> 43:16.065
What's wrong? You look so pale.

616
43:16.665 --> 43:18.905
I'm fine. I'm just terrified of the dark.

617
43:18.985 --> 43:20.345
Have you seen Jinzi?

618
43:20.425 --> 43:22.305
I thought I heard Jinzi just now.

619
43:23.225 --> 43:25.265
But then it was gone again.

620
43:26.105 --> 43:27.145
Right.

621
43:28.825 --> 43:29.665
Gejin.

622
43:49.025 --> 43:50.065
Jinzi!

623
43:51.585 --> 43:52.465
Jinzi?

624
44:27.945 --> 44:30.145
How do you propose we form this alliance?

625
44:30.225 --> 44:32.465
You're fickle and cast people aside once they've served their purpose.

626
44:32.545 --> 44:34.665
I can't trust you, unless…

627
44:34.745 --> 44:35.905
Unless what?

628
44:35.985 --> 44:39.985
Unless we remarry and become husband and wife again.

629
44:43.905 --> 44:46.185
Then you'll have to prove

630
44:47.625 --> 44:49.185
what you're capable of first.

631
44:55.585 --> 44:56.665
Where's Chilan?

632
44:59.025 --> 45:01.865
Oh, that girl. The day's just started,

633
45:01.945 --> 45:03.305
and she's already off somewhere shirking her duties.

634
45:04.745 --> 45:05.825
She's not like that.

635
45:07.305 --> 45:08.305
You needn't attend to me.

636
45:08.905 --> 45:10.065
Go and look for Chilan.

637
45:10.665 --> 45:11.505
-Yes. -Yes.

638
45:19.705 --> 45:20.945
I'll go at once.

639
45:31.065 --> 45:33.745
I remember giving you a gold necklace set with sapphires.

640
45:34.265 --> 45:36.145
Later, when you pawned your jewelry,

641
45:36.225 --> 45:37.785
you picked out that piece and returned it to me.

642
45:38.305 --> 45:39.505
I thought perhaps you didn't like it.

643
45:39.585 --> 45:43.225
So I had a finer one made for you.

644
45:44.145 --> 45:45.185
See if you like this one.

645
45:46.225 --> 45:47.825
General Qi, the truth is…

646
45:47.905 --> 45:49.945
If you're going to turn it down, please don't say it.

647
45:50.545 --> 45:52.305
If you want a husband to join your household,

648
45:52.385 --> 45:53.985
I have an elder brother,

649
45:54.065 --> 45:56.425
so marrying into your family would be no problem.

650
45:57.545 --> 45:59.345
Lu Zhuo is the Duke's heir, though.

651
45:59.425 --> 46:00.265
Can he do that?

652
46:00.345 --> 46:01.985
Such groveling, General Qi.

653
46:02.065 --> 46:03.465
Aren't you afraid your father will die of anger?

654
46:07.425 --> 46:09.985
I knew you'd be scheming behind my back again.

655
46:10.065 --> 46:12.465
Your Ladyship, don't fall for his tricks.

656
46:13.025 --> 46:14.305
He's been like this since childhood.

657
46:14.825 --> 46:17.265
Now, he seems modest and easygoing,

658
46:17.345 --> 46:19.705
but behind closed doors, he's full of tricks and schemes.

659
46:19.785 --> 46:20.905
Behind closed doors?

660
46:21.425 --> 46:22.345
As if you haven't played your share of tricks.

661
46:22.945 --> 46:24.505
I'm honest and aboveboard.

662
46:25.185 --> 46:26.265
What tricks have I played?

663
46:34.425 --> 46:37.785
Do you think Wei Rao is that shallow?

664
46:40.945 --> 46:42.105
You're one to talk.

665
46:42.185 --> 46:43.665
Don't think I don't know you've been watching her,

666
46:43.745 --> 46:44.665
trying to win her over by staying close.

667
46:45.425 --> 46:46.305
You can't hide it from me.

668
46:46.945 --> 46:47.785
Your Ladyship!

669
46:50.625 --> 46:52.185
Your Ladyship, something terrible has happened.

670
46:59.665 --> 47:00.625
Her Ladyship is here.

671
47:07.545 --> 47:09.545
Chilan!

672
47:12.545 --> 47:13.665
Chilan…

673
47:15.145 --> 47:15.985
What happened?

674
47:16.065 --> 47:18.105
Someone fetching water found her in the river this morning.

675
47:18.905 --> 47:21.265
She may have slipped and fallen in.

676
47:22.505 --> 47:24.225
Pull her out of the way.

677
47:28.145 --> 47:30.145
Chilan!

678
47:44.985 --> 47:45.985
Nothing between her fingers.

679
47:46.665 --> 47:48.905
-No sand or waterweeds. -Nothing in her mouth either.

680
47:50.065 --> 47:51.265
What does that mean?

681
47:52.585 --> 47:55.305
If she'd been alive when she fell in, she would have struggled,

682
47:55.385 --> 47:58.105
and there'd usually be weeds or sand lodged between her fingers.

683
47:58.825 --> 47:59.705
Unless…

684
48:00.665 --> 48:02.625
Unless someone threw her into the river after she was dead.

685
48:12.265 --> 48:13.865
What happened here?

686
48:13.945 --> 48:14.825
Who did this?

687
48:14.905 --> 48:15.705
Who could've done this?

688
48:15.785 --> 48:19.185
Without my permission, no one here is to leave.

689
48:19.265 --> 48:20.945
How could this happen?

690
48:21.025 --> 48:22.225
Who did this?

691
48:22.825 --> 48:24.585
-How could she end up here? -Right.

692
48:28.985 --> 48:30.025
It's Jinzi.

693
48:50.745 --> 48:51.865
What's wrong?

694
48:51.945 --> 48:54.385
That silly girl lost the jade bracelet Your Ladyship gave her.

695
48:54.465 --> 48:55.545
She cried all last night.

696
48:55.625 --> 48:57.025
How embarrassing.

697
49:01.265 --> 49:02.305
Here.

698
49:02.385 --> 49:04.345
This is to replace it. Don't cry.

699
49:05.345 --> 49:06.185
Thank you, Your Ladyship.

700
49:07.905 --> 49:09.145
It belonged to Chilan.

701
49:09.905 --> 49:11.185
Why is it near the cellar?

702
49:11.825 --> 49:13.905
Bring me all the workers who've been digging the cellar over the past ten days.

703
49:14.465 --> 49:15.665
-Yes. -Yes.

704
49:45.305 --> 49:47.265
I'm innocent, My Lord!

705
49:52.265 --> 49:53.225
It was you?

706
49:53.305 --> 49:54.545
It wasn't me.

707
49:54.625 --> 49:55.905
It really wasn't me!

708
49:58.665 --> 50:00.705
I'm innocent, My Lord!

709
50:00.785 --> 50:01.625
How dare he?

710
50:01.705 --> 50:03.345
How could anyone do such a thing?

711
50:03.425 --> 50:04.865
How could he commit such an murder?

712
50:04.945 --> 50:06.345
How could he do that?

713
50:06.425 --> 50:08.945
Lu Zhuo, I leave this man to you.

714
50:09.025 --> 50:11.145
Whatever methods you use,

715
50:12.185 --> 50:13.625
before sunset today,

716
50:15.225 --> 50:18.065
I want to know why he killed Chilan, who'd done nothing wrong.

717
50:18.665 --> 50:19.585
There's no need to wait till sunset.

718
50:19.665 --> 50:20.505
-He was nice fellow, but why? -Indeed.

719
50:20.585 --> 50:22.985
-I'll have your answer within an hour. -How could he do such a thing?

720
52:34.185 --> 52:36.745
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
